---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Compare recorded eval runs across arms

Usage: aura eval compare [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the desktop window or terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

      --suite <SUITE>
          Only runs of this suite

      --arm <ARMS>
          Arms to compare, baseline first; repeatable (default: all)

      --tolerance <TOLERANCE>
          Relative change tolerated before a metric counts as a regression
          
          [default: 0.1]

      --fail-on-regression
          Exit with an error when any arm regresses against the baseline

      --baseline <BASELINE>
          Compare against this baseline file instead of the first arm

      --write-baseline <WRITE_BASELINE>
          Write the first arm's numbers to this baseline file

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
